  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "英語教學法及教案設計研究",
    "sub_ename": "STUDIES ON ENGLISH TEACHING METHODS AND LESSON PLAN DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在學習英語學和課程設計的基礎架構課程中，學生將學習英語教學理論和英語教學法的專業知識。學生將能夠具備國際視野來看待新世代學習者的差異。本課程將引導學生探索科技融合的創新教學，並具備獨立分析的能力。學生將能夠在設計教學教案時展示專業知識和理解力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to learn the principles of English language teaching and curriculum design. In this course, students are going to learn about developing professional knowledge of English teaching theory and methods. Students will be able to develop an international perspective towards the differences of the new learners. Students will be guided to explore an innovate teaching by integrating technology and have ability to analyze independently. Students will be able to demonstrate professional knowledge and understanding in designing teaching plans.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
