    "course_pol": "Class Rules:\n1. Tardiness is not permitted.\n2. Personal smartphone use is not allowed during class time.\n3. Using the internet to access resources is permitted.\n4. Students are expected to listen attentively while the teacher and classmates are speaking.\n5. Students may ask for sick leave or personal business leave.\n6. A friendly learning atmosphere built by all of us.",
